-\item $\deg A\ge0$;
-\item $A$ admits a smooth Hermitian metric with semipositive curvature.
-\end{enumerate}
-For $\deg A=0$ the metric can be chosen flat, and for $\deg A>0$ it can
-be chosen to have strictly positive curvature.
